# Generated build output and Visual Studio state.
#
# The project/solution files (*.sln, *.vcxproj, *.vcproj, *.filters), the command-line build
# scripts (*.cmd, *.lst), the ReadMe files, and the prebuilt zlib.lib / zlib.dll dependency are
# intentionally tracked and are NOT ignored here.

# Visual Studio / IntelliSense state
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.sdf
*.db
*.ipch
*.vsidx

# Compiler / linker output
*.obj
*.pdb
*.exp
*.ilk
*.idb
*.res
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.recipe
*.log

# Build output directories
IntermediateFiles/
LatestCompileOutputBackup/

# Libraries and binaries (keep the prebuilt zlib dependency)
*.lib
!zlib.lib
*.dll
!zlib.dll
*.exe

# Visual Studio upgrade reports
UpgradeLog.*
_UpgradeReport_Files/

# Backups
*.bak
